BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amrum
DTSTART:20260514T200000Z
DTEND:20260514T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T200000Z
UID:Nol7aCYItS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nTwelve-year-old Nanning learns of
  his parents’ hideous convictions and their Nazi past in this sea-shot\,
  boy’s-eye view of the upheaval on a North Sea island in the last days o
 f World War II.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/amrum\n\nEstimated start:
  13:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sundays
DTSTART:20260514T223000Z
DTEND:20260515T004000Z
DTSTAMP:20260514T223000Z
UID:CYhUkgopfj
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 117 mins (1h57m)\n\nAt 17\, Ainara faces a life-chan
 ging choice: after high school\, she considers becoming a nun. Her decisio
 n unsettles her family\, especially her aunt Montse\, who fears it means l
 osing freedom. The year's Goya Award standout offers a stirring tale about
  the fragile balance between faith and skepticism.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /festival/sundays\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Downtown (Sun 17 May\, 4:00 P
 M)\n\nEstimated start: 15:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sons of the Neon Night
DTSTART:20260515T013000Z
DTEND:20260515T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T013000Z
UID:HlrKLposBv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 124 mins (2h04m)\n\nAn elite cast of Hong Kong actio
 n legends assemble for this sprawling\, mega-budget thriller that hearkens
  back to the wildly ambitious\, hyper-stylized crime cinema that put Hong 
 Kong filmmaking on the international map.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival
 /sons-of-the-neon-night\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Downtown (Sat 16 May\, 
 11:30 AM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Body Blow
DTSTART:20260515T043000Z
DTEND:20260515T062000Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T043000Z
UID:TddWxmobPv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nDanger and desire go hand-in-hand
  as a musclebound young cop goes undercover in Sydney’s gay scene\, only
  to fall for an alluring twink fatale\, in Dean Francis’ explicit and ca
 mpy neo-noir that refracts the erotic thriller through an unapologetically
  queer lens.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/body-blow\n\nAlso playing at
 :\n  • Uptown House 2 (Sun 17 May\, 2:15 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 21:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:It Would Be Night in Caracas
DTSTART:20260515T193000Z
DTEND:20260515T212000Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T193000Z
UID:xRnsDXofH3
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nSet in Caracas during the 2017 pr
 otests\, this gripping social thriller follows a woman trapped in a city c
 onsumed by repression and chaos. When regime loyalists seize her apartment
 \, she is forced into hiding and begins to hatch a desperate plan in a per
 ilous bid to escape the country.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/it-would
 -be-night-in-caracas\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Downtown (Sat 16 May\, 6:3
 0 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 12:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Murder in the Building
DTSTART:20260515T220000Z
DTEND:20260515T235500Z
DTSTAMP:20260515T220000Z
UID:vjYHBdkBfT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 104 mins (1h44m)\n\nA crime writer and his film prof
 essor partner become caught up in a real-life mystery of their own when th
 ey witness a crime in the apartment across the courtyard of their Paris ap
 artment building.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/murder-in-the-building\
 n\nEstimated start: 15:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Balandrau\, Where the Fierce Wind Blew
DTSTART:20260516T010000Z
DTEND:20260516T031000Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T010000Z
UID:MBY4JaBQkT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 116 mins (1h56m)\n\nOn December 30\, 2000\, friends 
 climbing Mount Balandrau in the Catalan Pyrenees get caught in a sudden\, 
 savage blizzard. Visibility vanishes\, winds roar\, and survival becomes a
  desperate fight against one of the mountain’s deadliest storms. Produce
 r Guille Cascante scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ba
 landrau-where-the-fierce-wind-blew\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House
  1 (Sun 17 May\, 5:00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:I Want Your Sex
DTSTART:20260516T041500Z
DTEND:20260516T055500Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T041500Z
UID:CJfSfHXHkJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nWhen fresh-faced Elliot (Cooper H
 offman) lands an exciting job for renowned artist\, icon\, and provocateur
  Erika Tracy (Olivia Wilde)\, his fantasies come true as Erika taps him to
  become her sexual muse.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/i-want-your-sex\
 n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 1 (Sat 16 May\, 2:45 PM)\n\nEstima
 ted start: 21:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fifteen
DTSTART:20260516T065900Z
DTEND:20260516T084900Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T065900Z
UID:CLxaoLtyqy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nGrowing up is terrifying enough\,
  but for two best friends planning the ultimate quinceañera\, the real ho
 rror is what's growing inside one of them. Director Yossy Zagha scheduled 
 to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/fifteen\n\nAlso playing at:\n 
  • Uptown House 2 (Sat 16 May\, 9:00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 0:09
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
